WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.630
Oka...

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.460
Why did you not report its existence to us?

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.630
<b>Disaster Prevention & Crisis Management Office</b>

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.630
<b>Special Countermeasures Division</b>

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.210
To find out for myself what exactly Ibara is.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.710
That thing is our family's sworn enemy. It has committed
atrocities against humanity since time immemorial.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.460
What else could it be but an Oni?

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.670
I was merely adhering to mother's advice.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.920
The Myojin Shrine Maiden must see
through that which cannot be seen.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.920
She told me to rely on my own eyes and
avoid being swayed by other's judgements.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.170
Hazuki would say that.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:33.170
However, the duty of the Myojin family
remains to eliminate all Oni.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.540
And Ibara is one of them.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.040
It must not be allowed to roam within our world.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.960
Any Oni that cannot be returned to
the nether realm must be imprisoned.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.920
For eternity.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.790
Mou dou demo ii ya tte

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.580
Nagedashita kotae

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:18.380
Hakanaku saki hakanaku chiru kurikaeshi

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.920
Monotarinai mama de

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.830
Sou day by day ayunda

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.130
Cry mirai kurai

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:31.130
Mada tsukamenai twilight

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.500
Don't lose your way

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.670
Yume no himo musunde

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.080
Take me so high

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.920
Hashiri dasu brand new life

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:44.460
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:48.130
Nanatsu no iro daite

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.000
Go ahead, make my day

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.380
Kono te de aragae motto!

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.830
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.580
Risou kibou kaite

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.170
I won't let you down

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.460
Kono hana sakasete zutto!

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.130
Believe myself

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000
<b>Partner</b>

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.540
Who'da thunk the Black Team's base was in City Hall?

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.250
Probably because it's easier
to gather info on Oni sightings.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.330
Makes sense.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.380
Alrighty, then.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.880
Are we really going through with this, Kaede?

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.040
With your finesse, it'll be a total cinch!

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.710
But I don't have any finesse...

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.210
Excuse me! I've brought some refreshments!

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:46.380
Doesn't matter.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.790
B-but I insist! Have some!

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.540
Doesn't matter.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.790
Forget it. Time for Plan B!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.960
Charge!

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:04.750
Kaede?!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.460
Oh no~!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.830
Oh my gosh! What a mess!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.960
Are you okay?! You might catch a cold!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:15.710
Doesn't matter.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.460
I'm so sorry! Let me clean this up for you!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.500
Just go over there...

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.750
Doesn't matter.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:22.830
He's like a rock...

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.960
After rampaging through various provinces,

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:30.420
Ibara was imprisoned within a Yoroi thanks
to the efforts of Lady Enju Myojin.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:35.500
However, his malice never subsided and he
consequently killed whoever donned the armor,

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.880
so it was hidden within a temple.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:40.130
But our records show that it was ultimately lost
after an air-raid during the world war.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.290
As I recall, one of the Kijima family was
affiliated with that museum.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.210
Yes, the former curator.
An investigation will need to be done.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.040
Please sir, allow us to handle that.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.380
Absolutely not, any further association between
Ibara and the Midnight Sun is out of the question.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.250
We're done here.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.040
Lady Oka?

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:07.960
If Ibara truly is an Oni, then Kakeru should
have ceased to be human long ago.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.000
But Kakeru remains totally unchanged.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.460
You think he's human?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.420
Ridiculous.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:20.130
You're not human. You're an Oni.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:24.130
Because only an Oni could wear
that Yoroi and still be alive.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:28.670
Say what you want, but the fact is I never
lost sight of myself and stayed alive!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.330
I never became an Oni!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.330
What did you do with Ibara?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.460
We imprisoned him.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.290
He was simply using you to try and gain his freedom.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.420
The same goes for me.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.920
I was making use of Ibara's power for myself.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.210
But that's how a give-and-take relationship works!

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.040
Give-and take with an Oni?

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.290
I want to become a hero,
and I can't do that without Ibara's power!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:03.170
What can you even hope to accomplish?

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.460
Anything and everything!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.790
Even if there are limits to what I can achieve alone,

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:09.500
working with the members of
White Team is another story!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.210
You really are clueless, aren't you?

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.880
About Oka and the burden she bears.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.710
I have no idea.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.420
But... I know we can share that burden by working tog-

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.670
Grow the hell up. You're a joke!

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.710
The mark has appeared on Oka...

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:34.830
Oka is...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.250
the Shrine Maiden of Shikizakura.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:42.130
Save everyone? Never sacrifice anything?

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.750
Easy for you to say!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.210
Okay, that's enough.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.540
Just calm down, Lady Benio.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:50.630
Sounds like somebody could use a Shiruko biscuit.

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:51.460
Shut up.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.630
You feeling okay?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:54.960
I'm fine.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:56.670
That's good.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.500
So, you won't mind answering one of my questions then.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.460
What exactly happened during the Shikizakura ritual?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.670
What Shikizakura ritual?

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:07.920
Ukon! Watch your mouth!

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:10.210
But Kakeru here was directly involved, wasn't he?

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:11.330
Huh?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.880
Yep. Everybody in our line
of business knows who you are.

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.580
Because of 8 years ago.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.920
The one and only survivor.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.170
There's no doubt that something
irregular happened that night.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.460
What do you mean?

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:27.630
Ukon!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.420
If you ask me, I think Kakeru has a right to know.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.170
Ibara is an example of what I mean by "irregular".

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.670
A strange powered suit that we know nothing about.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.790
And an Oni by the name of Ibara
who lays dormant inside of it.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.960
Get to the point, please.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.460
Well, in other words, Ibara might be the one
who caused that whole disaster.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:49.790
No way...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:55.670
Let's drop the formalities.
Allow me to speak as your father for a moment.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.580
The Shikizakura ritual is close at hand.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:09.040
And that's why, I want to grant as many of your wishes
as I possibly can in the time left.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.130
The ritual ended in failure 8 years ago.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:17.670
And the aftermath has brought the nether realm
closer to us than ever before.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:24.420
The connection between the two realms must be
severed, and all Oni banished from whence they came.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.500
We cannot afford to push back
the ritual any further than we have.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.380
Oka... I know how agonizing your role is.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:37.040
If the world can be saved through my lone sacrifice,
then I will not hesitate to offer my life.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.330
Failure is not an option.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:44.290
The ritual must succeed, and Ibara is an unknown
element that we cannot let interfere in any shape or form.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.170
In spite of that, I chose...

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:48.710
In spite of that, I chose...

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:50.630
to believe...

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:51.250
to believe...

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.210
in Ibara!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.130
Naturally, that goes for Kakeru as well.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.500
I have faith in him.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.380
Lady Benio?

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.790
Lock him up until the ritual is complete.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.000
Ow...

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:16.500
I see now that giving you
so much freedom was a mistake.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.460
Dismissed.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.000
Please, sir! I have a request!

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:23.540
Ryo!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:26.130
I know it's foolish, but to fend off the Oni until the ritual,

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:29.290
I believe Ibara and Kakeru Miwa
are essential to our forces!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.790
You should know better than to step out of line!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.210
Even you feel the need to make your opinion known, hm?

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.540
If anything were to happen, I'll cut Ibara down myself!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.460
Sir! I beseech you!

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:46.960
Since you're both so persistent,
I'm willing to see how capable the boy is.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.000
Forgive my abruptness, but...

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.880
Allow me to be the one who faces him.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.000
Shikizakura.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.380
Shikizakura!

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:07.670
I'm sorry.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.210
For dragging you into all of this...

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:11.830
Don't sweat it!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.540
I'll admit it kinda surprised me.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.920
But hey, if this is what it takes to convince
everyone I'm worthy then so be it!

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:19.250
Kakeru, look.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.210
Wh-whoa, Oka?!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.380
I need you to see this.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.790
It's the mark of the Shrine Maiden.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.460
What's it mean?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.960
The Myojin family's duty is
to banish the Oni from this world.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:38.330
For centuries, we have performed a ritual that
severs the connection with the nether realm.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:42.290
So, is that the Shikizakura ritual I heard about?

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:46.210
Yes. It's been 8 years since the last ritual was held.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.330
Are you serious?!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.040
I should have explained this to you much sooner.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.580
About how the ritual and the disaster
from 8 years ago were connected.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.460
But... I just couldn't do it.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:00.880
I'm sorry.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.420
We're responsible for taking everything from you...

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.580
I'm so sorry.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.210
I don't blame you or the Myojin family.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.130
You were just trying to protect people from the Oni.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.250
Right?

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.000
Kakeru...

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:29.580
Yeah, so anyway, could you maybe
button up your blouse now?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.130
Don't worry! There'll be another chance for the ritual!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.710
Yes, you're right...

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.630
And this time Ibara and I will help you out!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.290
That would be very reassuring.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.250
All right! I'm fired up now!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.750
<b>Special Training Facility</b>

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:53.670
Here.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.380
Thanks. I'm gonna give it my all.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.920
Lady Oka and I are just a small part of
the larger whims of the Myojin family.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:06.960
The ritual 8 years ago was performed by Lady Oka's
mother, Lady Hazuki, and she ultimately lost her life.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:12.080
But the sole survivor of that incident
is now standing in front of us.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.330
For all we know, there could be a good reason for that.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.040
There totally is! For sure!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:23.170
Always so upbeat. I can never tell how serious you are.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.290
I'll be watching closely to see how your fight unfolds.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.580
Don't die.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.130
Ryo!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.330
Let's bet a bottle of Royal Top on who wins this thing!

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:41.670
Be quiet and watch.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.000
What's your problem?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.000
Just relax.

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.080
Let's kick butt, Ibara!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.790
We'll win this and prove our worth!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:52.580
Transform!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.130
You know, I ain't some lightbulb that
you can just switch on and off whenever.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.290
Oh, give me a break.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.920
So, we're fighting this big guy?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.880
Hot damn, I might actually have some fun this time!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.710
He may look like a big brawler, but when we saw him
fight he shot from behind like Haruko does.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.420
This'll be easy, all we gotta do is get in close and hi-

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.290
That was cheap! The starting bell hadn't even rung yet!

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.380
There's no such thing in a serious duel like this.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.630
Let's see what you're made of.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:48.170
You're certain about this, sir?

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:52.380
This is a chance for us to remove Ibara from the picture,
which is the safest course of action.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.000
So much for him not being the brawler type!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.880
Now we're talking! A no-holds barred death match!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.380
Bring the pain!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.420
Nice!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.920
You'll have to do better than that.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:23.920
Your attacks have no weight behind them!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.460
You lack true grit!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.880
That's why your punches are weak!

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.330
True grit?!

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.250
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.290
Issa's really having a ball out there.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.500
Nobody told me this is the kind
of test he was being given!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.330
Only an all-out battle can tell
us what we need to know.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.170
That kid said he would believe in Ibara.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.460
Now he has to prove how seriously he means that.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:55.330
Oh no...

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.920
You're going down, meathead!

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.170
Nothing will keep me from my dream!

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:05.170
What dream?

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.250
To secure a future... that is free of Oni!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.750
No matter how many wounds I receive!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.880
No matter how many sacrifices are made!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.210
The Oni will perish!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.920
That is what this Yoroi is for! And that is why I am here!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.380
Tell me! What is it that motivates you to fight?!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:34.210
Stupid question. Because the thrill
of it feels amazing, obviously!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.330
Then tell me how this feels!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.540
It friggin' hurts, dammit!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:47.290
I'm fighting for Ibara! To save him!

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.080
I never asked you to, twerp!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.000
You don't have to! It's what I do!

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.670
I save people who are in trouble, all of them!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.710
Ibara included!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.250
Because that's what I have to do to become a hero!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:10.790
A hero, huh?

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:13.250
He was always talking about that.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.750
But I didn't realize how important it was to him.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:19.630
He was serious about it the whole time.
It was never a joke.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.460
I see that now.

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.330
Oh, Kakeru...

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.250
Issa! You're going to use that?!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.330
He finally pulled out the stops, eh?

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:36.750
Slaying all Oni including the Shinja without
making a single sacrifice is impossible!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.920
We are not some kind of guardian angels!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.130
And we are not the heroes that you speak of!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:43.920
Nor shall we ever be!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.750
Wrong! We can be!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.130
Then prove it.

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:53.880
Show me your true grit!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.710
My laces broke...

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.500
Man, talk about unlucky.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.290
I just bought these shoes...

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.790
Uh oh, I hope nothing bad happened to Kakeru.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:17.290
You ain't seen... my full power... yet...

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:18.420
Kakeru!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.330
Oh no, Kakeru!

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.130
Sorry, but this is the reality, kid.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:25.250
Get up, Kakeru!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.040
Get up!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.250
Get up!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.790
And fight back!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:33.380
Kakeru!

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:40.500
First it was that damn Shinja and now it's this chubby
gorilla! They're all ruining my fearsome reputation!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.130
The hell are you crying for, twerp?!

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.630
All I wanted... was to protect you and everyone else!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.000
But I couldn't!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.880
It's no big deal. Just means I go
to sleep for a few more centuries.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.250
I'm sorry!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.790
Stow the apologies, dummy.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.580
You were never the problem.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:02.670
It's my stupid ass who can't figure things out.
I just don't remember!

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.330
What I wanted or even what motivated me!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.710
Ibara...

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.960
I can't remember squat and I don't have any grit!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.170
I rampage around trying to vent my frustration,
but it never leaves me satisfied!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.170
I'm an empty husk!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.580
And at the end of the day,
I'm just gonna forget all this, too...

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.960
Come on, don't say that!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.080
Let's think! There has to be another way!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:24.830
There ain't.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.170
All we can do now is give up and
say goodbye to this shitastic life.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.540
You have two ways out of this.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:36.670
You can sit there doing nothing
and kiss your shitastic life goodbye.

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.210
Or you can bite the bullet and make...

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.500
a last stand!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.920
I think you mean "we", don'tcha?

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.670
We only have two options to choose from.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.130
Give up...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.670
or stand up!

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:55.250
Kakeru!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:05.880
He stood up!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.080
Kakeru!

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.750
He should've just taken the easy way out.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:14.670
Ibara! Let's become real heroes!

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.460
That's my new line of work, huh? Sounds good!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.540
Time to show this big lump what we're really made of!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.920
We've got your true grit right here!

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.210
Let's tear it up!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.460
Now that's more like it!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.420
Throw everything you've got at me!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:37.880
Heroes come to the rescue, then they bash and smash!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:39.830
Excellent!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.330
We ain't done yet!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.290
Same here!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.790
That's enough!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:06.000
Kakeru Miwa. Ibara.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.250
You have proven your strength.

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.040
That was a splendid fight.

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:13.420
I hope you'll continue to use
that power in support of Oka.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.790
You've got some nerve talking
to us like that now, dickhead!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.420
Kakeru! Give him a piece of your mind, too!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:23.420
Thank you, I really appreciate you giving us a chance!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.130
Kakeru!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.830
That's not what I meant, twerp!

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.000
Kakeru!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:26.790
Oh be quiet!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.790
Way to go!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:27.790
Kakeru!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.630
The kid never doubted Ibara for a second.

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.880
Well, I pulled it off!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.210
What a relief! I'm so glad!

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.540
Aw, shucks...

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.920
Is he just a fool that hasn't thought this through?

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:42.920
Or is he something more?

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:56.000
<b>Break</b>

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:56.000
<b>Room</b>

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:49.500
Sorry for taking up your time like this, Mr. Kakeru Miwa.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.750
My name is Misuzu Hattori. I'm Ryo's mother.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.670
Oh wow, really? I owe so much to Ryo!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.330
There is something I want you to be aware of.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:04.580
Ryo's father... my husband was killed by a Shinja.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.290
He holds a grudge against all Oni for it.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.880
I had no idea...

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:15.880
I'm sure he must have lashed out against
you and Ibara in frustration more than once.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.040
I'm sorry about that.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.540
Oh no, not at all!

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:21.210
Please don't let him know I told you.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:24.830
Pinky promise.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.880
Uh, sure!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:36.420
<b>BREAK</b>

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:36.420
<b>ROOM</b>

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.790
Please do what you can to help Ryo.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.750
Are you really okay with this?

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:40.540
He's worth using.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:41.630
But sir!

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.880
Hazuki saved the boy and Oka trusts him.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.000
So I feel compelled to do the same.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.540
Understood.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:21:00.500
Ima kono shunkan ga owaranai you ni

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:04.500
Nan juu nen saki made tsuzukimasu you ni

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:10.960
Kirei na fuku datte kirenaku natte

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:15.330
Watashi dake ga inakunatta sekai de

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.500
Ano hi nigate datta cider

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.710
Kieta semi no koe

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.040
Unmei ni shizundeku

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.080
Mogaki kata mo wakarazu ni

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:31.920
Watashi no koto nante mietenai mitai de

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:35.790
Sakarau ki mo okinainda yo

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:41.460
Anata ga te o hiite kureta toki

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.330
Mieta kirei na sekai no iro

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:47.960
Sakura no saku kisetsu ni

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:52.130
Mujaki ni warau sore ni tsurarete

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:56.210
Kawaranai koto nante nai

00:21:56.210 --> 00:22:00.210
Kanashii mirai datte kitto sou desho

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:29.210
Hard to believe he's still alive.

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.040
It's okay, sir.

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.210
He poses no threat.
We'll handle him one way or the other.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.500
Hey, Shrine Maiden!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:38.170
What is it?

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:39.920
Kippei told me about who you really are!

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:40.710
Huh?!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:44.580
He said you're "the sweet, affluent, airheaded schoolgirl
who totally hit the archetype lottery jackpot!"

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:46.000
Th-the what now?

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Smile</b>

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:47.830
Next time: Smile.

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:50.460
What's "archetype" mean anyway?
